# Live-pull working files. `_live_now_*` is whatever the operator last pulled
# from a RUNNING session, so it is a moving, superseded snapshot: the copy taken
# on 2026-08-19 held 4488 of that session's eventual 6258 items, and 124 of its
# rows carried a provisional UNCENTRED z_ctr because their block was still open.
# The finished session belongs in docs/data/<date>_<mode>_<what>/ instead.
# Ignored because `git add -A` swept these into two separate commits otherwise.
docs/data/_live_now_*
